        "installation": "<p>Upload Zip file ajax-login-register to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.3.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested up to WordPress 7.1 compatibility.</li>\n<li>Updated plugin version to 1.3.1.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added functionality to close the pop-up by pressing the ESC key and by clicking outside the pop-up.</li>\n<li>Improved the design of the login, signup, and logout buttons.</li>\n<li>Added &#8220;Remember Me&#8221; checkbox functionality to the login form.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable/Disable add a telephone number field into the register form.</li>\n<li>Select Page/Post For Redirect After Login.</li>\n<li>Select Page/Post For Redirect After Logout.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "description": "<p>Easy to use front-end AJAX Login and Register popup plugin with no settings required. Shortcode: [AJAX-LOGIN_REGISTER]</p>\n"
